text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'All creatures able to block Elvish Bard do so.', 'All creatures get +X/-X until end of turn.', "All lands become 2/2 creatures until end of turn. They're still lands.", 'As Booby Trap enters the battlefield, choose an opponent and a card name other than a basic land card name.\nThe chosen player reveals each card they draw.\nWhen the chosen player draws a card with the chosen name, sacrifice Booby Trap. If you do, Booby Trap deals 10 damage to that player.', 'As Story Circle enters the battlefield, choose a color.\n{W}: The next time a source of your choice of the chosen color would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', 'As long as Storage Matrix is untapped, each player chooses artifact, creature, or land during their untap step. That player can untap only permanents of the chosen type this step.', 'As long as Thran Golem is enchanted, it gets +2/+2 and has flying, first strike, and trample.', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in their hand on the bottom of their library in any order, then draws that many cards.", 'At the beginning of each upkeep, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, Form of the Dragon deals 5 damage to any target.\nAt the beginning of each end step, your life total becomes 5.\nCreatures without flying can't attack you.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 200 or more cards in your library, you win the game.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have a card in hand, return Imaginary Pet to its owner's hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures on the battlefield.", 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', 'Change the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color word with another or one basic land type with another. (For example, you may change "nonblack creature" to "nongreen creature" or "forestwalk" to "islandwalk." This effect lasts indefinitely.)', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals their hand and discards all cards of that color.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during their next untap step.", "Creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Creatures you control have flying.', "Creatures you control have vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause them to tap.)", 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all Plains.', "Destroy all creatures you don't control. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking creature. You gain life equal to its power.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. Its controller reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. The player puts that card onto the battlefield, then shuffles all other cards revealed this way into their library.", 'Destroy target enchantment.', "Destroy target green creature. It can't be regenerated.\nDraw a card.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Destroy target white creature. It can't be regenerated.\nDraw a card.", 'Draw four cards.', 'Draw three cards, then discard a card.', 'Draw two cards.', "Dream Prowler can't be blocked as long as it's attacking alone.", 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Each player may search their library for up to X creature cards, reveal those cards, put them into their hand, then shuffle.', 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', "Each player's life total becomes the number of creatures they control.", "Each spell costs {3} more to cast except during its controller's turn.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.', 'Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+2 and has reach. (It can block creatures with flying.)', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has islandwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nWhenever enchanted creature attacks or blocks, its controller loses 3 life.', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G}{G}.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that land.)\nEnchanted land is an Island.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that land.)\nYou control enchanted land.', 'Enchant permanent\nYou control enchanted permanent.', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+2.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample and lifelink.\nEquip {3}', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", "First strike\nWhen Nekrataal enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\n{R}: Sandstone Warrior gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "First strike, protection from black and from red (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike. It can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black or red.)", "Flame Wave deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", 'Flash', 'Flying', 'Flying\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Foul Imp enters the battlefield, you lose 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhenever Hypnotic Specter deals damage to an opponent, that player discards a card at random.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice an artifact. If you don't, tap Yawgmoth Demon and it deals 2 damage to you.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nSacrifice Shard Phoenix: It deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.\n{R}{R}{R}: Return Shard Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Aven Cloudchaser enters the battlefield, destroy target enchantment.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Aven Fisher dies, you may draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Rathi Dragon enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice two Mountains.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Sage Aven enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Blinding Angel deals combat damage to a player, that player skips their next combat phase.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Sengir Vampire this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{1}{U}: Return Fleeting Image to its owner's hand.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{1}{U}: Target player reveals the top card of their library.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{B}: Regenerate Will-o'-the-Wisp. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{W}: Aven Flock gets +0/+1 until end of turn.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Flying, vigilance (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach, and attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Goblin Brigand attacks each combat if able.', "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Guerrilla Tactics deals 2 damage to any target.\nWhen a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Guerrilla Tactics, Guerrilla Tactics deals 4 damage to any target.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', "Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nAt the beginning of the end step, return Viashino Sandstalker to its owner's hand. (Return it only if it's on the battlefield.)", "Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nMagnivore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of sorcery cards in all graveyards.", 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nWhen Thundermare enters the battlefield, tap all other creatures.', 'If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.', 'If an opponent controls more lands than you, search your library for up to three Plains cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Kird Ape gets +1/+2 as long as you control a Forest.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', "Maro's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.", "Mortivore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards.\n{B}: Regenerate Mortivore.", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Needle Storm deals 4 damage to each creature with flying.', 'Nonbasic lands are Mountains.', "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", "Other Elf creatures get +1/+1 and have forestwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Other Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk.', 'Other Zombie creatures get +1/+1.\n{1}{B}, {T}: Return target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Other creatures you control get +0/+1.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", "Players play with their hands revealed.\nIf a player would draw a card, they reveal it instead. Then any other player may pay 2 life. If a player does, put that card into its owner's graveyard. Otherwise, that player draws a card.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Put target card from your graveyard on top of your library.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'Reach\n{X}{G}{G}: Silklash Spider deals X damage to each creature with flying.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Sanctum Guardian: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to any target this turn, prevent that damage.', "Sacrifice a Swamp: Regenerate target black creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Sacrifice a creature: Draw cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power, then discard three cards.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Nantuko Husk gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Spend only black mana on X.\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', "Spineless Thug can't block.", "Sudden Impact deals damage to target player equal to the number of cards in that player's hand.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Swarm of Rats's power is equal to the number of Rats you control.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Llanowar Behemoth gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Target blocking creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You draw a card for each Forest and green card in it.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You draw a card for each Mountain and red card in it.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', 'Target player loses life equal to the damage already dealt to that player this turn.', 'Target player mills half their library, rounded down.', 'Target player reveals three cards from their hand and you choose one of them. That player discards that card.', 'Target player shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'Target player untaps all basic lands they control.', 'The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage. You gain life equal to the damage prevented this way.', "